<title>UK: CU shares extend losses after 1996 figures.</title>
<headline>CU shares extend losses after 1996 figures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Commercial Union Plc extended their losses on Thursday after the previous day's announcement of the insurance company's 1996 new business figures, dealers said.</p>
<p>By 1035 GMT, Commercial Union shares were down 13-1/2p at 689.</p>
<p>&quot;A few people were disappointed by the figures and today's fall is following on from that,&quot; one market-maker said. &quot;The numbers were alright at first glance but some of the detail disappointed people.&quot;</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
